WEBVTT

00:03:59.204 --> 00:04:01.593
and, hopefully, triumphantly.

00:04:02.291 --> 00:04:04.799
That was the magic of Alvin Ailey.

00:04:04.823 --> 00:04:07.665
He was able to see you, in the audience,

00:04:07.689 --> 00:04:09.430
see me, as the dancer,

00:04:09.454 --> 00:04:11.434
and see the connection between us,

00:04:11.458 --> 00:04:14.448
and choreographed works
that connected us all.

00:04:14.472 --> 00:04:17.615
So you felt he was telling your story,

00:04:17.639 --> 00:04:21.327
while I felt I was dancing mine.

00:04:22.163 --> 00:04:24.356
I started dancing when I was six years old

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:25.561
in Philadelphia.

00:04:25.585 --> 00:04:26.735
I was skinny ...

00:04:28.196 --> 00:04:30.807
(Laughter)